<section class="ref-group"><h2>Battles <span class="n">46</span></h2><ul class="enc-list"><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-ankara"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-ankara.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Ankara</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1402</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Ankara was fought in 1402 in central Anatolia between Timur and the Ottoman sultan Bayezid I.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-vogelinsegg"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Vögelinsegg</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1403</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Vögelinsegg was fought on 15 May 1403 near Speicher in Appenzell, Switzerland, in the Appenzell Wars.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-stoss"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Stoss</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1405</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Stoss was fought on 17 June 1405 at the Stoss pass between Altstätten and Gais, Switzerland, in the Appenzell Wars.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-bo-co"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Bô Cô</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1408</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Bô Cô was fought in late 1408 in what is now Nam Định province, Vietnam, between the Later Tran forces of Emperor Gian Dinh and a Ming army under Mu Sheng.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-othee"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-othee.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Othée</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1408</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Othée was fought on 23 September 1408 near Othée, north-west of Liège.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-sanluri"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/image